  numpy=array([-2.25-4.75j,  3.25-5.75j])>

  If `x` is real, it is returned unchanged.

  For example:

  >>> x = tf.constant([-2.25, 3.25])
  >>> tf.math.conj(x)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2,), dtype=float32,
  numpy=array([-2.25,  3.25], dtype=float32)>

